{{also|Linggo}}
==Tagalog==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|tl|es|domingo||Sunday}}, but most likely mistakenly analyzed as {{m|tl|luminggo}} (e.g. ''Luminggo na'', "It's Sunday", which could have been taken to mean "It's been a week"), from which the word is derived by removing the seeming infix {{m|tl|-um-}}.

